","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123597","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123597","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123597.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123597.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Updated **Node3DEditorViewport::_apply_preview_material()** to check for **Key::CMD_OR_CTRL** instead of hardcoding **Key::CTRL**. This ensures that macOS users can use the Command (⌘) key to trigger the surface material override, matching what the viewport tooltip promises.\r\n\r\n**Testing Notes:**\r\n                      Note: I do not currently have access to a **macOS** machine to test this directly. I made the logic change using Godot's cross-platform Key::CMD_OR_CTRL enum. Could someone with a Mac please give this a quick test to confirm? \r\nThanks!","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github